#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:2
msgid "Keyboard Layout / TimeZone"
msgstr "Disposition clavier / fuseau horaire"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **Keyboard Layout / TimeZone** menu option configures the host's "
"locale, virtual console keymap, and timezone."
msgstr "L'option de menu **Disposition clavier / fuseau horaire** configure les paramètres régionaux, la disposition du clavier de la console virtuelle et le fuseau horaire de l'hôte."

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:7
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:13
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Paramètre"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:14
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:15
msgid "**Locale**"
msgstr "**Locale**"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:16
msgid "System locale (e.g., ``en_US.UTF-8``, ``fr_FR.UTF-8``)"
msgstr "Paramètres régionaux du système (par ex. ``en_US.UTF-8``, ``fr_FR.UTF-8``)"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:17
msgid "**VC Keymap**"
msgstr "**VC Keymap**"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:18
msgid "Virtual console keyboard layout (e.g., ``us``, ``fr``, ``de``)"
msgstr "Disposition du clavier de la console virtuelle (par ex. ``us``, ``fr``, ``de``)"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:19
msgid "**Timezone**"
msgstr "**Timezone**"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:20
msgid "System timezone (e.g., ``America/New_York``, ``Europe/Paris``)"
msgstr "Fuseau horaire du système (par ex. ``America/New_York``, ``Europe/Paris``)"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:23
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Fonctionnement"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:25
msgid "Current settings are read from ``localectl status`` and ``timedatectl``"
msgstr "Les paramètres actuels sont lus depuis ``localectl status`` et ``timedatectl``"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:26
msgid "Changes are applied immediately using:"
msgstr "Les modifications sont appliquées immédiatement à l'aide de :"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:28
msgid "``localectl set-locale`` — for locale"
msgstr "``localectl set-locale`` — pour les paramètres régionaux"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:29
msgid "``localectl set-keymap`` — for keyboard layout"
msgstr "``localectl set-keymap`` — pour la disposition du clavier"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:30
msgid "``timedatectl set-timezone`` — for timezone"
msgstr "``timedatectl set-timezone`` — pour le fuseau horaire"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:32
msgid ""
"If keyboard maps are not installed on the system, ``hpe-vm`` offers to "
"download and install the KBD keymaps package"
msgstr "Si les tables de clavier ne sont pas installées sur le système, ``hpe-vm`` propose de télécharger et d'installer le paquet KBD keymaps"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:34
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/keyboard_layout.rst:34
msgid ""
"Keyboard layout changes affect the local console immediately. SSH "
"sessions use the client's keyboard settings and are not affected."
msgstr "Les modifications de disposition clavier affectent immédiatement la console locale. Les sessions SSH utilisent les paramètres clavier du client et ne sont pas affectées."

